OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATeen couple jailed after
OL,4,Aattempting to buy a gun
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers who spoke about being a
OL,7,F"cute mass-shooter couple" in text
OL,8,Fmessages about their extremist
OL,9,Finterests have been jailed after trying
OL,10,Fto buy a gun.
OL,12,FSelf-declared neo-Nazis Rex Clark and
OL,13,FSofija Vinogradova were both 18 when
OL,14,Fthey tried to purchase a Glock 19
OL,15,Fpistol, after they were "radicalised by
OL,16,Fextremist and terrorist" material
OL,17,Fonline.
OL,19,FThese included Telegram channels
OL,20,Fpromoting neo-Nazi and "death cult"
OL,21,Fideology, the Metropolitan Police said.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
