OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATeen couple jailed after
OL,4,Aattempting to buy a gun
OL,5,
OL,6,FClark, now 20, of Ilford, east London,
OL,7,Fwas jailed at Kingston Crown Court on
OL,8,FMonday for six years, while
OL,9,FVinogradova, 21, of Cheshunt,
OL,10,FHertfordshire, was sentenced to
OL,11,Fsix-and-a-half years, the Crown
OL,12,FProsecution Service (CPS) said.
